  "scenario_brief": "TEST: Ops multi-factor sign-in\n\nA test floor for the second sign-in step (OPS_MFA_HELPDESK_PLAN.md, S8a). A lobby with a drop box, a wall port, an audit terminal and a cabinet; a floor with two PCs that ask for a six-digit code and three staff; a store room with a PC that sends a request to the owner's phone, one that asks for a number to be matched on the phone, one that asks for nothing extra, and three more staff. Nothing to solve.",
